### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### Variables globales
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/ld+json

### ═════════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. AUTH — Register & Login
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1.1 Créer un user (PUBLIC) — register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Dupont",
  "email": "jean@test.com",
  "password": "azerty123"
}

### 1.2 Créer un user admin (à faire en SQL une fois, voir bas du fichier)

### 1.3 Login — récupère le JWT
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login_check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jean@test.com",
  "password": "azerty123"
}

### Le token est extrait automatiquement de la réponse du login
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1.4 Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login_check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}


### ═════════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. USER — CRUD (auth requise sauf POST register)
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2.1 Liste des users (ADMIN only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2.2 Get user by id (auth — soi-même ou admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.3 Update user (PATCH partiel)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{
  "firstName": "Jean-Pierre"
}

### 2.4 Delete user (ADMIN only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ═════════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. ROLE — CRUD (ADMIN only)
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════

### 3.1 Liste des rôles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3.2 Créer un rôle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "ROLE_MANAGER",
  "label": "Gestionnaire"
}

### 3.3 Assigner un rôle à un user (PATCH sur user)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{
  "userRoles": ["/api/roles/1"]
}


### ═════════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. COACH
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════

### 4.1 Liste des coachs (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/coaches

### 4.2 Créer un coach (ADMIN only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/coaches
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Sophie",
  "lastName": "Martin",
  "email": "sophie@coach.com",
  "phone": "0612345678",
  "password": "coachpass",
  "pricePerHour": 50
}

### 4.3 Get coach by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/coaches/1


### ═════════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. SEANCE
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════

### 5.1 Liste des séances (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/seances

### 5.2 Créer une séance (ADMIN/COACH only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/seances
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Yoga matinal",
  "coachId": 1,
  "maxUser": 10,
  "startTime": "2026-05-15T09:00:00+02:00",
  "endTime": "2026-05-15T10:00:00+02:00"
}

### 5.3 Get séance by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/seances/1


### ═════════════════════════════════════════════
### 6. RESERVATION — auth obligatoire
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════

### 6.1 Liste mes reservations (auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6.2 Réserver une séance (auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "seanceId": 1,
  "reservationTime": "2026-05-15T09:00:00+02:00"
}

### 6.3 Annuler une reservation (auth)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═════════════════════════════════════════════
### 7. ERREURS — pour vérifier que la sécu marche
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════

### 7.1 Tenter de réserver sans token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "seanceId": 1,
  "reservationTime": "2026-05-15T09:00:00+02:00"
}

### 7.2 User normal qui tente de delete un autre user → 403
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7.3 Login avec mauvais password → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login_check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jean@test.com",
  "password": "wrong"
}


